er":"L237","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1","s-west","orchid-camp"],"depart":3300,"plain":"HORSE, ATTACK AT ORCHID CAMP.","cipher":null},{"seq":505,"t":3300,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1720,"retries":0},{"seq":506,"t":3300,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"My doctrine dictates holding the east ford with elephants and archers on the north bank. Kite inf-1 and ele-1 are at F3 (East Ford) (2w ago). kite-arch-1 is at N-East (2w ago). I will reinforce these positions using the reliable units (kite-inf-2, kite-cav-1) and send out scouts."},{"seq":507,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c197","house":"kite","letter":"L238","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":3600,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":"RNLKJO BKKS, ITQLD SK NTRS BKQO."},{"seq":508,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c198","house":"kite","letter":"L239","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":3600,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":"DKQRN, ITQLD SK NTRS BKQO."},{"seq":509,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c199","house":"kite","letter":"L240","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":3600,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT NORTH BANK EAST.","cipher":"AKWINJ, DKHO TS JKQSD ATJG NTRS."},{"seq":510,"t":3300,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1636,"retries":0},{"seq":511,"t":3300,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"My doctrine is to make peace early via letter. I will send a ciphered letter to all houses to initiate talks, aiming to secure a truce before the end. I will reinforce F2 as it is the central ford."},{"seq":512,"t":3300,"type":"courier","id":"c200","house":"orchid","letter":"L241","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":3600,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"AEQRT AKKT, DKHS BT RKUTD LBJG IESSHM."},{"seq":513,"t":3300,"type":"courier","